  74:./Libraries/STM32_USB-FS-Device_Driver/src/usb_core.c **** * Function Name  : Standard_SetConfiguration.
  75:./Libraries/STM32_USB-FS-Device_Driver/src/usb_core.c **** * Description    : This routine is called to set the configuration value
  76:./Libraries/STM32_USB-FS-Device_Driver/src/usb_core.c **** *                  Then each class should configure device itself.
  77:./Libraries/STM32_USB-FS-Device_Driver/src/usb_core.c **** * Input          : None.
  78:./Libraries/STM32_USB-FS-Device_Driver/src/usb_core.c **** * Output         : None.
  79:./Libraries/STM32_USB-FS-Device_Driver/src/usb_core.c **** * Return         : Return USB_SUCCESS, if the request is performed.
  80:./Libraries/STM32_USB-FS-Device_Driver/src/usb_core.c **** *                  Return USB_UNSUPPORT, if the request is invalid.
  81:./Libraries/STM32_USB-FS-Device_Driver/src/usb_core.c **** *******************************************************************************/
  82:./Libraries/STM32_USB-FS-Device_Driver/src/usb_core.c **** RESULT Standard_SetConfiguration(void)
